{"type":"message","id":"4a24e12e","parentId":"4574ae49","timestamp":"2026-03-24T05:56:44.304Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_2H5YSD4Ch0uUPqWSXog9ODNB|fc_050a45ec585c4d650169c2279b8c848191b78e80d4fc093ece","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"body\":\"**\\u003csub\\u003e\\u003csub\\u003e![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)\\u003c/sub\\u003e\\u003c/sub\\u003e  Keep the Feishu skill roots declared in the manifest**\\n\\nRemoving `skills` here drops `extensions/feishu/skills/**` from the plugin manifest entirely. `src/plugins/manifest.ts` does not auto-discover a `skills/` directory, `src/agents/skills/plugin-skills.ts` only exposes paths listed in `record.skills`, and `scripts/copy-bundled-plugin-metadata.mjs` only bundles declared skill paths. `registerFull()` in `extensions/feishu/index.ts` only registers runtime tools/hooks, so it does not replace these SKILL.md prompts; after this change, enabled Feishu installs lose the `feishu-doc`/`feishu-drive`/`feishu-perm`/`feishu-wiki` guidance, and packaged builds omit those skills completely.\\n\\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-03-23T03:14:59Z\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/52597#discussion_r2972632842\",\"line\":4,\"path\":\"extensions/feishu/openclaw.plugin.json\",\"user\":\"chatgpt-codex-connector[bot]\"}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":452,"aggregated":"{\"body\":\"**\\u003csub\\u003e\\u003csub\\u003e![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)\\u003c/sub\\u003e\\u003c/sub\\u003e  Keep the Feishu skill roots declared in the manifest**\\n\\nRemoving `skills` here drops `extensions/feishu/skills/**` from the plugin manifest entirely. `src/plugins/manifest.ts` does not auto-discover a `skills/` directory, `src/agents/skills/plugin-skills.ts` only exposes paths listed in `record.skills`, and `scripts/copy-bundled-plugin-metadata.mjs` only bundles declared skill paths. `registerFull()` in `extensions/feishu/index.ts` only registers runtime tools/hooks, so it does not replace these SKILL.md prompts; after this change, enabled Feishu installs lose the `feishu-doc`/`feishu-drive`/`feishu-perm`/`feishu-wiki` guidance, and packaged builds omit those skills completely.\\n\\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-03-23T03:14:59Z\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/52597#discussion_r2972632842\",\"line\":4,\"path\":\"extensions/feishu/openclaw.plugin.json\",\"user\":\"chatgpt-codex-connector[bot]\"}","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774331804292}}
