aF7gFXl4GWACWBptSA8_Oz4SWdn_gkCRH4x9wsbsJKsdrm0oX5kq64yhzSHtZWjj-VsxVzZ2-jo2xuf-dFHqOfF-RYwYG4msWSveO92H7MuAkiTBZ9lkAAHyGYBvlHETFxVq2Fx3p1fwS14H62_vSSuef6IKSnVFYejw9HcUVGxBKrPFcmw58J48xlierOWucfxsUf0apPO9lc2tPSkUl1iIBiP1t0wEmw7A-kKoTPzLP3W0YkgP87O0X6xfDW3_GJhrr7zjOejGustuwRuGtfAfdx13Ry4VZh5wx1Aa4dpT19B6YLr_9qVKGz_yE0NNUAx8KTLSMktYdBSCfi460ecrSPAUfJ3SQjHidyjmzD6_gVw1T_Zh_P0eL1q0GJmWnLD15J5zOkfoBRQYSoPgamsvoX0hVjrwGRNvoZ28baNiVuiGaMIyo5SE6AkEevprfLuz5jeMjJhdz6t7ChUf2fJaCPS3LLbpoeLsOnIHkGbEeBjY6WWfj6c1RzZRMLNQvvrbuEz7MD\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Reviewing pull request status**\\n\\nI need to check the current status, maybe looking at unresolved issues and review threads. I can use the GitHub API for comments and see if the branch has been updated since the last comment. I should summarize the situation: it's open, CI is red, and there are comments suggesting keeping the manifest skills due to exposure loss. Also, tasks dispatched for xixi/aoao are awaiting return. I might need to check on session delivery but could skip mentioning that. I'll get a concise summary in Chinese too!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 进度我已经推进了，结论先说：\n\n1. **xixi 调研任务已派**\n   - 目标：找 3 个值得做的 OpenClaw 高质量贡献入口\n   - 方向：可复现 bug / 文档缺口 / 小而有价值改进\n   - 状态：**已发出，等回报**\n\n2. **aoao 复核/找 bug 入口任务已派**\n   - 目标：从审查视角找 2-3 个高价值问题入口\n   - 方向：行为不一致 / 文档与实现不符 / 配置和多 Agent 易踩坑点\n   - 状态：**已发出，等回报**\n\n3. **昨天的 PR #52597 我查完了**\n   - PR：`fix(feishu): avoid double skill registration`\n   - 链接：https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/52597\n   - 作者：你（`EronFan`）\n   - 当前状态：**OPEN，CI 失败，不是可直接合并状态**\n\n**这个 PR 现在的关键问题，不在“重复注册”本身，而在修法有副作用。**\n\n我看到的核心情况：\n- 你这个 PR 的做法是：删掉 `extensions/feishu/openclaw.plugin.json` 里的 `\"skills\": [\"./skills\"]`\n- 但 **Codex review 提了一个实质性拦截意见**：\n  - 这会把 `extensions/feishu/skills/**` 从 plugin manifest 里移除\n  - 结果是 `feishu-doc / feishu-drive / feishu-perm / feishu-wiki` 这些 **SKILL.md 指导能力会丢**\n  - 打包产物里也可能不再带这些 skills\n- 也就是说：\n  **你修掉了“双注册”，但有较大概率把 Feishu skills 的 skill prompt 暴露链路一起删没了。**\n\n另外：\n- CI 有不少 job fail 了，包含：\n  - `check`\n  - `checks (node, test, 1/2)`\n  - `checks (node, test, 2/2)`\n  - `checks (node, extensions, pnpm test:extensions)`\n  - `checks (node, contracts, pnpm test:contracts)`\n  - 多个 `checks-windows`\n- 你本地写了 `pnpm test:extension feishu` 过了，说明：\n  **局部 Feishu 测试过了，但 repo 级别检查没过。**\n\n我的判断很直接：\n- **PR #52597 当前不适合硬推 merge**\n- 主要不是 reviewer 刁难，而是 **这个修法确实可能把 skill 发现/打包链路搞坏**\n- 这条 review 值得正面处理，不是噪音\n\n我建议下一步别绕：\n1. **先确认 OpenClaw 的 `record.skills` / bundled metadata / plugin-skills` 这条链路**\n2. 判断“runtime tool registration”和“skill prompt discovery”是不是两套机制\n3. 如果是两套机制：\n   - 不能直接删 manifest 的 `skills`\n   - 应该改成 **避免 runtime 重复注册**，而不是砍掉 skill 声明\n4. 然后我可以继续帮你：\n   - 读相关源码\n   - 定位真正重复发生在哪一层\n   - 直接给出一个更稳的修法\n\n你一句话，我下一步就继续把 **#52597 的正确修复路径** 挖出来。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_050a45ec585c4d650169c227a4dbbc8191b04cd2ef12134492\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":494,"output":922,"cacheRead":36480,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":37896,"cost":{"input":0.0012350000000000002,"output":0.01383,"cacheRead":0.00912,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.024184999999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774331804301}}
