{"type":"message","id":"05a89c53","parentId":"8d77976e","timestamp":"2026-03-24T05:58:26.084Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_TMhm2N9SEWfOeQ2qkXXYSGHf|fc_050a45ec585c4d650169c227fdb42481918fe78b31bbf2f6d0","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/.git/hooks/commit-msg.sample:18:# This example catches duplicate Signed-off-by lines.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator/.git/hooks/commit-msg.sample:18:# This example catches duplicate Signed-off-by lines.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator/node_modules/@types/node/http.d.ts:27: * See `message.headers` for details on how duplicate headers are handled.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator/node_modules/@types/node/http.d.ts:257:         * It joins the field line values of multiple headers in a request with `, ` instead of discarding the duplicates.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator/node_modules/@types/node/http.d.ts:1295:         * To allow duplicate values of the headers listed above to be joined,\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator/node_modules/@types/node/http.d.ts:1299:         * * For duplicate `cookie` headers, the values are joined together with `; `.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator/node_modules/@types/node/http.d.ts:1326:         * Header names are not lowercased, and duplicates are not merged.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator/node_modules/@types/node/vm.d.ts:737:     * // cache would probably be used to avoid duplicated modules.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator/node_modules/@types/node/http2.d.ts:1692:         * Header names are not lowercased, and duplicates are not merged.\n/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator/node_modules/@types/node/readline.d.ts:351:         * If `true`, when a new input line added to the history li