hile not addressing the true root cause with enough confidence.\\n\\nI\\'ll close this and continue investigating the original duplicate-registration report from the real loader/runtime path instead. If I can isolate the actual cause, I\\'ll follow up with a narrower fix or a better issue write-up.\\n\\nThanks for the review — the concern about keeping the Feishu skill roots declared in the manifest was valid.' && gh pr close 52597 --repo openclaw/openclaw","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":60},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"gh pr comment 52597 --repo openclaw/openclaw --body $'Re-checking this more carefully, I no longer think this is the right fix direction, so I\\\\'m closing this PR to avoid pushing the wrong change.\\\\n\\\\nWhat changed in my understanding:\\\\n- `extensions/feishu/openclaw.plugin.json` `\\\"skills\\\": [\\\"./skills\\\"]` is used for plugin skill-directory discovery / packaging of Feishu AgentSkills (`SKILL.md`), not as the runtime tool-registration path for `feishu_doc`, `feishu_chat`, etc.\\\\n- The actual Feishu tool registration in production code is still coming from `extensions/feishu/index.ts -> registerFull(api)`.\\\\n- Removing `skills` here risks dropping Feishu skill prompts from the plugin manifest / bundled metadata without proving that it fixes the original duplicate-registration report.\\\\n\\\\nSo this PR would likely introduce a regression while not addressing the true root cause with enough confidence.\\\\n\\\\nI\\\\'ll close this and continue investigating the original duplicate-registration report from the real loader/runtime path instead. If I can isolate the actual cause, I\\\\'ll follow up with a narrower fix or a better issue write-up.\\\\n\\\\nThanks for the review — the concern about keeping the Feishu skill roots declared in the manifest was valid.' && gh pr close 52597 --repo openclaw/openclaw\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":60}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":101326,"output":623,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":101949,"cost":{"input":0.253315,"output":0.009345000000000001,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.26266}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774353431012}}
