{"type":"message","id":"a495cf47","parentId":"bef7c48d","timestamp":"2026-03-24T13:08:32.413Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Clarifying response needs**\n\nI want to keep it simple. Since we're replying in this group, it seems obvious that the current group is routed to the main session. I’m thinking I might not need to reference any prior memory since we’re only dealing with the current state. That should make answering straightforward without needing to dig into anything from the past. Let’s see how this unfolds!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_050a45ec585c4d650169c28ccbf5108191b7d14e3f83aeecdf\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpwozPxxS9aV4_VX5WgDojvCyX61s2uVSRrSE2rvnSQr5VykZyBlrGtfLYZ-GfgcqiZJFqDZn1FWdfkE0erCYzBzgqWEOB-ncSiWE86bboBWGVUCpvK0ck6ZTn-2mpAn77b96zMIkjs4lOlfVRPismEKno7MthzNNrXzH2XDwXnbwBb3TgyFzztFHFcQqEauPbohF4XQhHrFNO79QLvOLCGw-PABOq0ujEUPv_ubWzsENja6tIIKnSAFTOIKNnbeNK8hdRPrpyeTxiUUzTpwraVaXXCPXAQ5N68OAbd1B0dH8Wl6sANhwVJELg64uxCttrukeikh_NwdesxvefqszCVWGrm_PpHSY10_tfjdsygHeVGsyTHeunoKLAs7ob-q6Ei0MKL65xK6KnGUYaCWelXHs2l8smD8xTeXuAHk6IpZqqkUq0DPHohEdylorFYfWA6kdmipKfMd__VUyfXgrKgPJzDrgrLLPTRaltlPqjzViS2vUuJHt0uLkBbDGQ1YY9GKyj_Z049T-RdMnN7pc_68KYhOEfn7A0GdqeDNgep-_4lis6eX_eIRe0_LV-pyNyu3CmE6yeatxRQ2U8AqsdoB1GOm4InHwmp-BVSVavJ7TjECrWh9PL9V_kY503qs_AQUd7Yjx-okIuIXZojjnN9HGdG325VUcImeIJLekEUOBdcR9V5EYWT9OzS9xgbwrYdeVm478TbLC5v4z7xYKiisvvNA9xA0prdwvW3w3f5Yyn6pS3icYGVcs2ZBjmffUS6NkWOK7BN_ADJvXVPAWazNUT_BE6Tg5TMnAbPRfjvz5RXyasYTlOk7A_JctUiQOkXhykEc1VSkH5PwpR5sWZJzGtQREf7gwVp55VYVFw4VotHUSZkmjVg3GXsUANdrLO_nKshYsY740kKzCCV79HUL88YVa8c39R3LB_MMib0O7QbbmDd75Q59dc0RkDmul2GHSMUkt_8m_HViWx_3YVtwzWGIZJQaRJhLtKuLQSJYs6RA7ztpziXNgD9wbnihe4MVmS75Q939_liWYj_oxOpf3a7SSSEBqgcGZ0OHnvk81i7EVNEsUau0y5LP-scDHydjDp\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Clarifying response needs**\\n\\nI want to keep it simple. Since we're replying in this group, it seems obvious that the current group is routed to the main session. I’m thinking I might not need to reference any prior memory since we’re only dealing with the current state. That should make answering straightforward without needing to dig into anything from the past. Let’s see how this unfolds!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 接上了。\n\n证据很直接：\n- 我现在就在这个飞书群里正常收到你的消息\n- 也能在这里直接回你\n- 当前这个群已经路由到 **main** 这个 group session\n\n按当前元数据看：\n- channel：**feishu**\n- chat_id：`oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3`\n- 类型：**group**\n- 当前处理者：**main**\n\n所以结论就是：**这个群的路由是通的。**\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以继续帮你查两件事：\n1. 这个群是不是**稳定绑定**到 main  \n2. 其他 agent 在各自私聊 / 群里是不是也都路由正常","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_050a45ec585c4d650169c28ccf4fd48191a437efdc76cac6de\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":982,"output":217,"cacheRead":102400,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103599,"cost":{"input":0.002455,"output":0.003255,"cacheRead":0.025599999999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03131}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774357706542}}
